    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of blocks! In this colorful and cosy life-sim, you are a &quot;Blocksmith,&quot; a rare individual with the power to build and shape the world around you. Start with a blank slate and transform it into a thriving, customized town filled with unique villagers, cozy homes, and plenty of heartwarming activities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Dream Town</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your town  from scratch and shape it however you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new blocks and buildings as you progress, turning your town into a bustling community.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your blocksmithing skills to gather materials and bring your vision to life.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Own Community</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and create your very own townsfolk, from their appearance to their personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move villagers into your town, befriend them, and even choose a job or role for them in the community.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as your town becomes lively, with villagers interacting, working, and thriving.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Express Yourself</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your player with stylish clothing, accessories, and unique outfits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your house and garden with furniture, d\u00e9cor, and plants to make it truly your own.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxing Hobbies</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug collecting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gardening</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy The Changing Seasons</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your town transform through all four seasons, each bringing unique visuals, weather, and activities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind in your own charming and colorful world!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of blocks! In this colorful and cosy life-sim, you are a &quot;Blocksmith,&quot; a rare individual with the power to build and shape the world around you. Start with a blank slate and transform it into a thriving, customized town filled with unique villagers, cozy homes, and plenty of heartwarming activities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Dream Town</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your town  from scratch and shape it however you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new blocks and buildings as you progress, turning your town into a bustling community.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your blocksmithing skills to gather materials and bring your vision to life.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Own Community</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and create your very own townsfolk, from their appearance to their personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move villagers into your town, befriend them, and even choose a job or role for them in the community.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as your town becomes lively, with villagers interacting, working, and thriving.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Express Yourself</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your player with stylish clothing, accessories, and unique outfits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your house and garden with furniture, d\u00e9cor, and plants to make it truly your own.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxing Hobbies</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug collecting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gardening</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy The Changing Seasons</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your town transform through all four seasons, each bringing unique visuals, weather, and activities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind in your own charming and colorful world!</p>",
